  "description": "Fluent OData client for Microsoft Dynamics 365 Finance and Operations. Provides a strongly-typed, LINQ-enabled query builder with support for CRUD operations, cross-company queries, and automatic token management. Supports both Azure AD (Cloud) and ADFS (On-Premise) authentication. Supports multiple D365 sources via named service factory.",
